---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions | Event Tools" description="Terms of use for Event Tools' free browser-based calculators and planners.">
	<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose dark:prose-invert">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-2">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
		<p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>

		<h2>Using this site</h2>
		<p>
			Event Tools provides free, browser-based calculators and planners for event and party
			planning. No account or payment is required to use any tool.
		</p>

		<h2>Estimates, not guarantees</h2>
		<p>
			Every tool on this site produces an estimate based on general planning guidelines and the
			numbers you enter. Actual results for your specific event may vary based on factors a
			generic calculator can't account for — venue specifics, guest behavior, local vendor
			practices, and more. Use these tools as a planning starting point, not a substitute for
			advice from your venue, caterer, or event professional.
		</p>

		<h2>No warranty</h2>
		<p>
			This site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We work to keep every
			calculator accurate, but we don't guarantee the results are error-free or fit for any
			particular purpose.
		</p>

		<h2>Acceptable use</h2>
		<p>
			Don't attempt to disrupt the site, scrape it at abusive volume, or use it for any unlawful
			purpose. We reserve the right to block access for abuse.
		</p>

		<h2>Changes</h2>
		<p>We may update these terms as the site evolves. Continued use after a change means you accept the updated terms.</p>

		<h2>Contact</h2>
		<p>Questions? See the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
